WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.840
He calls — (we answer!)

2
00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:03.600
He leads — (we follow!)

3
00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:04.140
He knelt — (we rise!)

4
00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:08.260
He prayed — (we're ONE!)

5
00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:14.580
I've carried His name through a lifetime of Sundays,

6
00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:17.960
worn out my knees and I've worn out my doubt;

7
00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:22.160
I've buried some friends and a few of my certainties —

8
00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:25.400
but the God who has wept with me never walked out.

9
00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:27.680
On the night before the garden,

10
00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:30.340
with the olive trees in sight,

11
00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:35.240
He looked past the ones beside Him,

12
00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:39.200
and He prayed for us that night —

13
00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:43.020
We are the ones He prayed for —

14
00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:46.200
the ones He would not leave behind.

15
00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:50.640
That they all may be one, as the Father and Son —

16
00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:53.220
one voice, one mind.

17
00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:56.460
He calls — (we answer!)

18
00:00:57.440 --> 00:00:58.060
He leads — (we follow!)

19
00:00:58.420 --> 00:00:58.540
He knelt — (we rise!)

20
00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:01.760
He prayed — (we're ONE!)

21
00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:08.240
I've got a thousand questions and no one to ask,

22
00:01:09.120 --> 00:01:11.420
a phone full of noise and a heart full of maybe;

23
00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:15.820
I don't know the hymns that the old ones are singing,

24
00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:19.980
but Someone keeps calling — and I think He's calling me.

25
00:01:19.980 --> 00:01:21.700
Before He knelt in the garden,

26
00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:24.940
sore amazed beneath the weight,

27
00:01:26.140 --> 00:01:28.920
He looked down the road of ages —

28
00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:32.880
and He saw me. And He prayed.

29
00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:36.680
We are the ones He prayed for —

30
00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:39.960
the ones He would not leave behind.

31
00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:44.260
That they all may be one, as the Father and Son —

32
00:01:44.800 --> 00:01:46.740
one voice, one mind.

33
00:01:47.680 --> 00:01:51.140
We are the ones He prayed for,

34
00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:54.460
and the answer's you and I —

35
00:01:55.180 --> 00:01:58.620
He is real, He is near, and He's holding us here —

36
00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.760
one voice, one mind.

37
00:02:05.620 --> 00:02:07.560
He wept — (we're healed!)

38
00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:09.180
He bled — (we live!)

39
00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:10.600
He rose — (we kneel)

40
00:02:11.360 --> 00:02:11.860
He prayed — (we're ONE!)

41
00:02:13.160 --> 00:02:16.480
He didn't come down for the polished and perfect —

42
00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:20.080
He came for the cracked and the earthen like me.

43
00:02:20.620 --> 00:02:23.860
His grace isn't payment — it's power that rebuilds us,

44
00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:26.980
not crushed by a standard, but learning to be.

45
00:02:27.920 --> 00:02:30.740
He's set out a table, no gatekeeper at the door —

46
00:02:30.940 --> 00:02:34.400
not a name, not a one turned away anymore —

47
00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:38.160
and this is how the world is gonna know:

48
00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:41.820
by the love that carries one another home.

49
00:02:42.060 --> 00:02:45.180
I see through a glass, and I see only part —

50
00:02:45.280 --> 00:02:48.620
but I know what I felt, and I know He was there.

51
00:02:48.840 --> 00:02:52.200
When there's nothing but stubborn hope left in our hands —

52
00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:55.900
He holds on to us. He holds on to us.

53
00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:58.600
That they all may be one…

54
00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:02.300
That they all may be one…

55
00:03:02.740 --> 00:03:06.120
That they all may be one…

56
00:03:09.340 --> 00:03:10.940
as the Father and Son.

57
00:03:11.520 --> 00:03:12.900
We are the ones He prayed for —

58
00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:16.160
the ones He would not leave behind.

59
00:03:16.860 --> 00:03:20.360
That they all may be one, as the Father and Son —

60
00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:22.760
one voice, one mind.

61
00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:27.200
We are the ones He prayed for,

62
00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:30.580
and the answer's you and I —

63
00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:34.660
He is real, He is near, and He's holding us here —

64
00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:38.720
one voice, one mind.

65
00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:40.880
We fall — (He lifts!)

66
00:03:41.180 --> 00:03:41.760
We seek — (He finds!)

67
00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:44.660
We surrender — (He sets us free!)

68
00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:48.020
He prayed — we're ONE!

69
00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:51.180
In one voice, in one mind —

70
00:03:52.280 --> 00:03:55.760
we come home.

71
00:03:55.760 --> 00:03:58.560
to Him.
